          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.562,
            0.047,
            0.848,
            0.065
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Expressions Using Letter-Numbers"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.088,
            0.848,
            0.126
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us start with design C. It appears for the first time at position 3, the second time at position 6."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.134,
            0.617,
            0.158
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Where would design C appear for the "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { \\mathrm { t h } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " time?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.166,
            0.849,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We can see that this design appears in positions that are multiples of 3. So the "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { \\mathrm { t h } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " occurrence of Design C will be at position 3n."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.213,
            0.848,
            0.253
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Similarly, find the formula that gives the position where the other Designs appear for the "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { \\mathrm { t h } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.262,
            0.749,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The positions where B occurs are 2, 5, 8, 11, 14, and so on."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.282,
            0.848,
            0.338
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We can see that the position of the nth appearance of Design B is one less than the position at which Design C appears for the "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { \\mathrm { t h } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " time. Thus, the nth occurrence of Design B is at position:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.467,
            0.343,
            0.531,
            0.36
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_16_equation_8.jpg",
          "content": "3 n - 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.365,
            0.848,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Similarly, the expression describing the position at which the design A appears for the nth time is: 3n – 2."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.412,
            0.847,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Given a position number can we find out the design that appears there? Which Design appears at Position 122?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.462,
            0.848,
            0.52
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If the position is a multiple of 3, then clearly we have Design C. As seen earlier, if the position is one less than a multiple of 3, it has Design B, and if it is 2 less than a multiple of 3, then it has Design A."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.527,
            0.847,
            0.568
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Can the remainder obtained by dividing the position number by 3 be used for this? Observe the table below."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.577,
            0.824,
            0.694
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.155,
                0.577,
                0.824,
                0.694
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_16_table_13.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Position no.</td><td>Quotient on division by 3</td><td>Remainder</td></tr><tr><td>99</td><td>33</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>122</td><td>40</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>148</td><td>49</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.714,
            0.8,
            0.738
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Use this to find what design appears at positions 99, 122, and 148."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.766,
            0.432,
            0.787
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Patterns in a Calendar"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.797,
            0.848,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here is the calendar of November 2024. Consider "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\times 2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " squares, as marked in the calendar. The numbers in this square show an interesting property."
            }
          ]
        },
